@startuml Accident Scene Steps

title Accident Scene Procedure — S·H·N

start

partition "S — Sichern (Secure the Scene)" {
    :Turn on **hazard lights** immediately;
    :Put on **high-visibility vest** (Warnweste)\nbefore exiting the vehicle;
    :Place **warning triangle** behind the accident;
    note right
        Normal road: ~100m back
        Autobahn: ~100-150m back
    end note
}

partition "H — Helfen (First Aid)" {
    :Check on injured persons;
    if (Is the person unconscious?) then (yes)
        if (Are they breathing?) then (yes)
            :Place in **recovery position**\n(Stabile Seitenlage);
        else (no)
            :Begin **CPR**;
        endif
    else (no)
        :Stop severe **bleeding** with pressure;
    endif
    note right
        Do NOT move seriously injured
        persons unless there is immediate
        danger (e.g. fire).
    end note
}

partition "N — Notruf (Emergency Call)" {
    :Call **112** (fire / ambulance)\nor **110** (police);
    :Give the following information;
    note right
        **Where?** Exact location
        **What?** What happened
        **How many?** Number of injured
        **What injuries?** Type of injuries
        **Wait** for questions —
        do not hang up first.
    end note
}

:Stay at the scene;
note right
    Leaving is a criminal offence
    in Germany (Fahrerflucht).
end note

stop

@enduml
